2026-05-06 12:32:28,298 - RagChatService - INFO - Interaction: {"query": "What all can BDS help me do?", "answer": "BDS (BSG Data System) can assist you in several key areas related to membership and activity management within Bharat Soka Gakkai (BSG):\n\n1. **Maintain Accurate Membership Records**: BDS helps track total registered members, new members, and inactive members across all organizational levels.\n\n2. **Track Activity Participation**: You can record and monitor attendance at meetings (Zadankai), events, campaigns, and other activities.\n\n3. **Monitor Organizational Health**: BDS allows you to assess member engagement, identify new members (Friends), and track inactive members.\n\n4. **Enable Bottom-Up Reporting**: Data flows from the Block level up to the National level, facilitating comprehensive reporting and analysis.\n\n5. **Support Leadership Decision-Making**: The data collected can aid in making informed decisions at various leadership levels.\n\n6. **Ensure Consistency in Data Recording**: BDS standardizes how statistics are recorded across India, promoting uniformity in data management.\n\n7. **Generate Reports**: You can create various reports, such as attendance summaries and member status reports, to analyze data effectively.\n\n8. **Member Management**: BDS allows you to search for individual members and manage their records, including updates on their status and participation.\n\nOverall, BDS serves as a centralized tool for managing and reporting organizational data, enhancing member care and engagement efforts within BSG [0].", "tokens": 0, "time": 116.11303170002066, "confidence": 0.5231970310211181, "cached": false, "sources": ["73f7a66ee64e0bb2162aa5ec8e9fdddf", "5a17c59c405475c30263b0004434e935", "975e9e53846f4039845a736b5e7c0560", "3a78a45613f8fcdc404c5e14ed7d9a1a", "43dcfa86643dae81057e4463a6f18828", "8886244862e645b5271de593a593bc1e", "c52c73ed1693b7683cbfe49c05d4d74c", "8d0fa578f069c440a1d3409530facff6", "c05d96d996bae803a966fbac